  "description": "Mission: Break the Curse of Your Favorite Idol with Your Own Body! \n\nA voice actor who secretly adores the virtual YouTuber “Yu-Won.” The real Yu-Won suddenly bursts into the voice actor’s home! “Jeong-Han,” Yu-Won’s true identity, claims to be in a ghostly state! To become a normal person, he must receive love… But he has to release that love through physical contact?! That’s a total win-win, isn’t it…?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
